   "rating": 8.8,
   "checkInDateMonthAndYear": "May 2026",
   "encryptedReviewData": "QMy9sc42CAZSs0E1T72lGA==",
   "formattedRating": "8.8",
   "formattedReviewDate": "May 16, 2026",
   "formattedReviewHelpfulText": "Did you find this review helpful?",
   "ratingText": "Excellent",
   "responderName": "Palette Bella B All Suites Bangkok Hotel",
   "responseDateText": "Responded May 25, 2026",
   "responseText": "Dear Guest,\n\nThank you for your review rating and your detailed feedback. We are delighted to hear that you were satisfied with your long-term stay, our convenient location, the daily replenishment of drinking water and coffee, as well as your use of the hotel’s swimming pool and fitness facilities.\n\nAdditionally, we appreciate your suggestions regarding the operating hours of the swimming pool and fitness center; we will certainly take these into consideration as we strive to further enhance our guest experience.\n\nWe look forward to welcoming you back again in the near future.\n\nWarm regards,\nLiya\nPalette Bella B All Suites Bangkok Hotel",
   "responseTranslateSource": "en",
   "reviewComments": "It's not extremely close, but it's within walking distance to the train station and bus stop.\n\nIt's about a 10-minute walk north to Tops and CAFE Amazon, and about a 15-minute walk to Iconsiam (although you'll be sweating a lot).\n\nThe hotel replenishes bottles of water and stick coffee every day.\n\nFor some reason, the pool and gym are open from 6:00 AM to 6:00 PM, and there is no night pool. I think it would be more enjoyable if they were open from 9:00 AM to 9:00 PM or 8:00 AM to 8:00 PM.\n\nIn the morning, I take a boat (6 baht) across the river for breakfast. After coming back, I go to the pool and take a break at the hotel. From 3 PM, I go back to the pool and then go outside for sightseeing around 5 PM. Since it's hot during the day, I didn't feel like going out, and since the pool is on the rooftop, I only went in before noon and in the evening.\n\nI had a great time staying for several nights.",
   "reviewNegatives": "",
   "reviewPositives": "",
   "reviewProviderLogo": "",
   "reviewProviderText": "Agoda",
   "reviewTitle": "I am very satisfied.",
   "translateSource": "ja",
